{
  "id": "1057",
  "title": "Catching Fire",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-07-04",
  "synopsis": "Do you know the difference between “to get angry” and “to catch fire”?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1057/99f9a74a5c1244eb9ff6052170b58271b5641394.mp3?1613220944",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "发火\n\n本：老师，“发火”和“生气”这两个词有什么不一样？\n老师：你生气的时候，不一定发火；但是发火的时候，一定很生气！",
    "traditional": "發火\n\n本：老師，“發火”和“生氣”這兩個詞有什麼不一樣？\n老師：你生氣的時候，不一定發火；但是發火的時候，一定很生氣！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Catching Fire"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：老师，“发火”和“生气”这两个词有什么不一样？",
      "traditional": "本：老師，“發火”和“生氣”這兩個詞有什麼不一樣？",
      "pinyin": "běn lǎo shī fā huǒ hé shēng qì zhè liǎng ge cí yǒu shén me bù yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Teacher, what is the difference between the two words “to catch fire” and “to get angry”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老师：你生气的时候，不一定发火；但是发火的时候，一定很生气！",
      "traditional": "老師：你生氣的時候，不一定發火；但是發火的時候，一定很生氣！",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nǐ shēng qì de shí hou bù yí dìng fā huǒ dàn shì fā huǒ de shí hou yí dìng hěn shēng qì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: When you get angry, you don’t necessarily catch fire. But when you catch fire, you’re definitely angry!"
    }
  ],
